# Files that must never be published.
#
# This repository is public and its history is permanent: once a file has
# been pushed, deleting it later does not remove it. The lines below stop
# GitHub Desktop from offering these files for commit in the first place.

# The paper-level publication audit. It names individual authors and
# records unverified "no publication located" findings, so it stays private.
*Publication_Audit*
*publication_audit*

# Spreadsheets in general. Nothing on this site is published as a
# spreadsheet; the datasets in data/ are CSV and TXT. If you ever want to
# publish a spreadsheet deliberately, delete these two lines first —
# otherwise GitHub Desktop will quietly refuse to show it.
*.xlsx
*.xls

# Temporary lock files that Excel and Word create while a file is open.
~$*
